    {
      "id": "claim_135e065f2fb640619c8af4a6e7a11b28",
      "statement": "TA's make localstack-db provisions a disposable, licensed LocalStack RDS PostgreSQL instance (via scripts/localstack-db.sh and compose.localstack-db.yml), bootstraps the schema and an IAM-auth application role through the server's bootstrap subcommand, and writes a gitignored .env.localstack-db consumed by make run-localstack-db; make localstack-db-down tears down the container, its volume and the env file. All three require LOCALSTACK_AUTH_TOKEN because RDS is a LocalStack Pro feature.",
